  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-visits-the-dentist-v3-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "6b6a7310cb5ecdccdfd8ade3cd6c61a04f561bf83b5f78d0e298253c05ef3f84",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4b2eea346c6c18e40f556a94dec3cf280dd8c94280a6ed260ca91e2a30c0031b",
      "text": "悟空看牙医",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "27cb9633d68ff481a47151ae850a13f624ea99751aaf51750445515f33aaa57a",
      "text": "今天，悟空\n要去看牙医。\n沙僧陪他一起去。\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6aad41641265420d86678a982200f1a10ae1067e2ebf87b2165e6169d6faf11e",
      "text": "八戒也在候诊室。\n“嗨，悟空！”\n悟空看见一张大椅子。\n“哇！”\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f22155642616e0b7fbc890a0f7c2aa2bafdbbe6b6dda3db9f195e931f9d78b4f",
      "text": "嗡嗡，嗡嗡！\n“是大蜜蜂吗？”\n悟空拉紧沙僧的手。\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1f31c79cca5ff6163d02d4f5d95a4a8a7151f48541063a619a4d27f44fb38cea",
      "text": "牙医阿姨笑了。\n她的衣服上有好多小熊。\n“你好，悟空！\n我们先看一看。”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b9024618d0027dc53a9fc07044c482199d4c7ff6ef501fb744652a3f8b3455bc",
      "text": "她拿出一面小镜子：\n“它能帮我看清\n你的牙齿。”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ff8906794a1dbc27dd7441b9ef7ce0c1e1d08611249c425dda2dc41027342d82",
      "text": "“如果你想停一下，\n就举起手，\n我就会停下来。”\n悟空点点头。\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "165bb593d3169a9692966014a452c8b22eeddce5fe49b99b4774224634c16c75",
      "text": "悟空爬上大椅子。\n牙医阿姨问：“准备好了吗？”\n椅子慢慢升高了！\n“像坐在小云朵上！”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "472ca031fbd2924a556addfc002d7896ec6d82d75f2d355ccec2ff1e29fa0f3a",
      "text": "牙医阿姨说：“张大嘴巴。”\n“啊——”\n她一颗一颗地看。\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "57f44d1ff275128be161e97dd8a34426b5af6a401059f8e1302e0c666cdb0d64",
      "text": "嗡——\n悟空有点害怕，\n他举起了手。\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "43d126820ec0dfb38bc11f968ece198b7990811cc47151aaa4a85104abf403f8",
      "text": "牙医阿姨马上停下来：\n“好的，我们停一停。”\n沙僧握住他的手。\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c9eb91a31b7502bc18f825c7e20f084b97c5655d80cdd706f3f7ffcd1206dccf",
      "text": "悟空问：\n“是什么在嗡嗡响？”\n牙医阿姨说：“是我的小刷子，\n有点痒痒的。”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "05fb6963d0267bd70fd5d5767bcbd55b969f66ef86b433165803dc6fb4306bdc",
      "text": "悟空说：\n“我准备好了。”\n他又张大了嘴巴。\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "dacc305f40b0efa8a1d83706814fe804f9842a0aba55d89f72e0b53912efb0f9",
      "text": "嗡嗡，嗡嗡，\n痒痒的！\n牙医阿姨说：“检查完啦！”\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b1dab1d21a75fc2c7a4ba2f58fa3df652c6477c82788b0fa47f3e21a9e4a3a83",
      "text": "悟空照着小镜子笑：\n“我会告诉你我需要什么！”\n临走时，牙医阿姨\n送给他一把小牙刷。\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b87506dd9e216e6a898a3f8418fed86ed83f749349744e73b0fd6005b27c5e88",
      "text": "回到家，八戒的玩偶排好队。\n悟空说：“张大嘴巴！\n如果想停一下，\n就举起小爪子！”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
